    "https://careers.lsuhsc.edu/jobs/assistant-professor-associate-professor-clinical-psychiatry-new-orleans-louisiana-united-states": {
      "title": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, PSYCHIATRY",
      "description": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, PSYCHIATRY - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, PSYCHIATRY - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, PSYCHIATRY 497469 New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Faculty Medicine Add to favorites View favorites Title: ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, PSYCHIATRY Employee Type: Faculty Department: Psychiatry Campus Location: PSYCHIATRY/PAID/FACULTY/STAFF Job Summary/Basic Functions The Department of Psychiatry of the Louisiana State University Health Sciences Center (LSUHSC) School of Medicine at New Orleans is seeking an Adult Psychiatry faculty at the rank of Assistant Professor or Associate Professor (non-tenure, clinical track) to work in the New Orleans Area. The successful candidate will have demonstrated expertise in clinical work at various sites: private, hospital based, and FQHC. Confidence in supervising multiple trainees is preferred. This is an excellent opportunity to be an integral part of providing mental health services to the New Orleans community. Minimum Qualifications Required Education: MD or equivalent Other Education if applicable: Required Field of Study: General Psychiatry Certifications or Licenses Required: Board Certified or eligible (or equivalent) in Psychiatry; Licensed to practice in Louisiana and credentialed with all required entities by start date Additional Information About Our School/Department Comprehensive benefits are available to eligible employees and their dependents including health, life, dental, and vision insurance; flexible spending accounts; retirement plans; generous annual and sick leave; 14 paid holidays per year; and an employee health primary care clinic. See following link for more details on our benefits offerings: LSUHSC, New Orleans - Benefits Other employee benefits include a full-servi