      "title": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - PLASTIC SURGERY",
      "description": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - PLASTIC SURGERY - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - PLASTIC SURGERY - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - PLASTIC SURGERY 497373 New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Faculty Medicine Add to favorites View favorites Title: ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - PLASTIC SURGERY Employee Type: Faculty Department: Surgery Campus Location: SURGERY/FULL TIME Job Summary/Basic Functions The Division of Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery, Department of Surgery in the School of Medicine at LSU Health Sciences Center in New Orleans, Louisiana is seeking a BE/BC (or equivalent) plastic surgeon for an academic faculty position at the rank of Assistant Professor, Associate Professor, or Professor. Academic rank and track will be determined based on qualifications, experience and stature in the field. Responsibilities include clinical care, research and teaching in plastic surgery. Clinical activities will be primarily centered at University Medical Center - New Orleans, a full service, regional facility. There are leadership opportunities within the department and within the clinical facility for candidates with leadership experience. Minimum Qualifications Required Education: MD or equivalent Other Education if applicable: Completion of plastic surgery residency training prior to hire date Certifications or Licenses Required: BC/BE (or equivalent) surgeon; must be licensed to practice medicine in Louisiana and credentialed with all required entities before date of hire Additional Information About Our School/Department Comprehensive benefits are available to eligible employees and their dependents including health, life, dental, and vision insurance; flexible spending accounts; retirement plans; generous annual and sick leave; 14 paid holidays