    "https://careers.lsuhsc.edu/jobs/assistant-professor-associate-professor-revised-new-orleans-louisiana-united-states": {
      "title": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR/ ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR-REVISED",
      "description": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR/ ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR-REVISED - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States ASSISTANT PROFESSOR/ ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR-REVISED - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! ASSISTANT PROFESSOR/ ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR-REVISED 497082 New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Faculty Dentistry Add to favorites View favorites Title: ASSISTANT PROFESSOR/ ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR Employee Type: Faculty Department: LSUNO Prosthodontics Campus Location: PROSTHODONTICS-FIXED/DENTAL SC Job Summary/Basic Functions Responsibilities for this position will center on learner-centered pre-doctoral level didactic, preclinical and clinical instruction in prosthodontics. Applicants should possess the skills and knowledge to provide clinical coverage in all aspects of prosthodontics and general dentistry. Experience with the use and application of digital dentistry, as well as implant restorations and conventional fixed and removable prosthodontics is highly desired. The dentist will work collaboratively within all disciplines of the department and other departments of the LSUHSC School of Dentistry. The applicant will be able to participate in the faculty dental practice. The position’s requirements include a DDS or DMD degree or foreign equivalent. A certificate in Prosthodontics is preferable. Applicants must be highly skilled in operative dentistry, fixed and removable prosthodontics and implant restorations. The applicant must also be skilled at interdisciplinary treatment planning. A strong knowledge of the use and application of digital dentistry and high-level esthetic dentistry is desired. The dentist will work collaboratively within all disciplines of the department and other departments of the LSUHSC School of Dentistry. Minimum Qualifications Required Education: DDS/DMD Required Field of Study: General Dentistry Certifications or Licenses Required: Louisiana Dental License Number of years required to perform the job: 3 Type of experience required to perform the job: Experience in restorative dentistry and Prosthodontics Preferred Qualifications Certifications or Licenses Preferred: Certificate in Prosthodontics Preferred Experience: Applicant must be highly skilled in operative dentistry, fixed and removable prosthodontics and implant restorations. The applicant must also be skilled at interdisciplinary treatment planning. A strong knowledge of the use and application of digital dentistry and high-level esthetic dentistry is desired. Experience with the use and application of digital dentistry, as well as implant restorations and conventional fixed and removable prosthodontics is highly desired. Additional Information About Our School/Department Comprehensive benefits are available to eligible employees and their dependents including health, life, dental, and vision insurance; flexible spending accounts; retirement plans; generous annual and sick leave; 14 paid holidays per year; and an employee health primary care clinic. See following link for more details on our benefits offerings: LSUHSC, New Orleans - Benefits Other employee benefits include a full-service credit union, wellness benefits featuring complimentary fitness center membership for employees and their spouses, employee assistance program, campus assistance program, and pet insurance option. More information about these benefits can be found on this webpage: Additional Benefits Apply Now! Sign up for job alerts! Job Alert 09e3a7c0 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments LSUNO Prosthodontics (NO12280) LSUNO Prosthodontics (NO12280) Locations New Orleans, Louisiana, United States New Orleans, Louisiana, United States First Name (required) 0494dc52 Last Name (required) 58cc3850 Email (required) 5093c239 Send Please wait... Done Not Yo