    "https://careers.lsuhsc.edu/jobs/assistant-professor-or-associate-professor-clinical-hematology-oncology-new-orleans-louisiana-united-states": {
      "title": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR OR ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, HEMATOLOGY/ONCOLOGY",
      "description": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR OR ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, HEMATOLOGY/ONCOLOGY - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States ASSISTANT PROFESSOR OR ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, HEMATOLOGY/ONCOLOGY - New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! ASSISTANT PROFESSOR OR ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, HEMATOLOGY/ONCOLOGY 496511 New Orleans, Louisiana, United States Faculty Medicine Add to favorites View favorites Title: ASSISTANT PROFESSOR OR ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, HEMATOLOGY/ONCOLOGY Employee Type: Faculty Department: Med-Hematology and oncology Campus Location: MEDICINE/NEW ORLEANS Job Summary/Basic Functions The LSU Health Sciences Center, Department of Medicine, Section of Hematology and Oncology in New Orleans, seeks an enthusiastic faculty member at the rank of Assistant Professor or Associate Professor (non-tenure, clinical track). The candidate will participate in teaching medical students, residents and fellows, delivering clinical service, and participate in our various research programs. Experience is preferred, but junior faculty with excellent training and a special interest in teaching should apply. LSUHSC offers an excellent benefit package, and salary is commensurate with experience. Minimum Qualifications Required Education: MD or equivalent Certifications or Licenses Required: Board Certified/Eligible (or equivalent) in Hematology/Oncology; Licensed to practice medicine in Louisiana and credentialed with all required entities before start date Additional Information About Our School/Department Comprehensive benefits are available to eligible employees and their dependents including health, life, dental, and vision insurance; flexible spending accounts; retirement plans; generous annual and sick leave; 14 paid holidays per year; and an employee health primary care clinic. See following link for more details on our benefits offerings: LSUHSC, New Orleans - Benefits Other employee benefits include a full-service c