    "https://careers.lsuhsc.edu/jobs/assistant-professor-associate-professor-professor-clinical-neurotology-baton-rouge-louisiana-united-states": {
      "title": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, NEUROTOLOGY",
      "description": "ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, NEUROTOLOGY - Baton Rouge, Louisiana, United States ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, NEUROTOLOGY - Baton Rouge, Louisiana, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, NEUROTOLOGY 496595 Baton Rouge, Louisiana, United States Faculty Medicine Add to favorites View favorites Title: ASSISTANT PROFESSOR / ASSOCIATE PROFESSOR / PROFESSOR - CLINICAL, NEUROTOLOGY Employee Type: Faculty Department: Otolaryngology Head & Neck Surgery Campus Location: OTORHINOLARYNGOLOGY/FACULTY/ST Job Summary/Basic Functions The Department of Otolaryngology-Head & Neck Surgery of LSU Health, New Orleans is actively seeking a candidate for a faculty position at the rank of Assistant Professor, Associate Professor, or Professor (non-tenure, clinical track) fellowship trained in Otoloty/Neurotology to practice in Baton Rouge, LA. This is an excellent opportunity to join our growing practice. Responsibilities include patient care, resident and medical student education, and the pursuit of clinical research. Extensive collaborative research opportunities are available. Our faculty team members enjoy liberal cross-coverage for weekend and holiday on-call responsibilities and share the benefit of subspecialty support in otology, laryngology, head and neck oncology, pediatric otolaryngology, and plastic/reconstructive surgery. Salary and rank will be commensurate with the knowledge, education and experience of the individual. Minimum Qualifications Required Education: MD or equivalent Other Education if applicable: Fellowship trained in Otology/Neurotology Certifications or Licenses Required: BC/BE (or equivalent) in Otolaryngology; Licensed practice medicine in Louisiana before date of hire Apply Now! Sign up for job alerts! Job Alert 732dfdff Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You ca